      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The [`vDSP_blkman_window`](vdsp_blkman_window.md) and [`vDSP_blkman_windowD`](vdsp_blkman_windowd.md) functions create a Blackman window vector using the following operation:",
      "normalizedSource": "The [`vDSP_blkman_window`](vdsp_blkman_window.md) and [`vDSP_blkman_windowD`](vdsp_blkman_windowd.md) functions create a Blackman window vector using the following operation:",
      "sourceHash": "0881daf824a87cad6c3c1b00fa61b0721966ee714d462ecc2586b239026ad01e",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```objc\nfor (n=0; n < N; ++n)\n{\n    C[n] = 0.42 - (0.5 * cos(  2 * pi * n / N ) ) +\n             (0.08 * cos( 4 * pi * n / N) );\n}\n```",
      "documentTitle": "vDSPblkmanwindowD",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
